   "rule": "Tree",
   "purpose": "A hierarchy of folders, projects or types. Each branch folds, and a click on a name shows its note.",
   "status": "approved",
   "variants": [
    [
     "Large tree with states: 24 nodes, 4 levels",
     "<div class=\"tree-box\"><div class=\"legend\"><span><i style=\"--c:var(--ok)\"></i>decided</span><span><i style=\"--c:var(--warn)\"></i>open</span><span><i style=\"--c:var(--bad)\"></i>gap</span></div><ul class=\"tree\">\n<li data-note=\"The source root.\"><span>src/</span>\n  <ul>\n  <li data-note=\"Events, ports and projections. No feature code.\"><span>Orchestrator.Kernel/</span>\n    <ul>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. Append with an expected version.\"><span>Events/</span></li>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. One interface for each outside system.\"><span>Ports/</span></li>\n    <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open. The rebuild runs on start only.\"><span>Projections/</span></li>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. One clock port for tests.\"><span>Clock/</span></li>\n    </ul></li>\n  <li data-note=\"One folder for each slice.\"><span>Orchestrator.Features/</span>\n    <ul>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. Registry, create, archive.\"><span>Sessions/</span>\n      <ul>\n      <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided.\"><span>Create/</span></li>\n      <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided.\"><span>Archive/</span></li>\n      <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open. Version 3 of the store.\"><span>Registry/</span></li>\n      </ul></li>\n    <li data-state=\"bad\" data-note=\"Gap. The state machine and the state check live in two places.\"><span>Lifecycle/</span>\n      <ul>\n      <li data-state=\"bad\" data-note=\"Gap. Duplicate states.\"><span>StateMachine/</span></li>\n      <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open. Moves into StateMachine.\"><span>StateCheck/</span></li>\n      </ul></li>\n    <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open. Delivery waits for task K3.\"><span>Messages/</span>\n      <ul>\n      <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided.\"><span>Inbox/</span></li>\n      <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open.\"><span>Delivery/</span></li>\n      </ul></li>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. Runs, steps, executors.\"><span>Workflows/</span></li>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. Definitions and render.\"><span>Templates/</span></li>\n    </ul></li>\n  <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open. Notion and file stores share no base.\"><span>Orchestrator.Store/</span>\n    <ul>\n    <li data-state=\"warn\" data-note=\"Open.\"><span>Notion/</span></li>\n    <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided.\"><span>Files/</span></li>\n    </ul></li>\n  <li data-state=\"ok\" data-note=\"Decided. The web host.\"><span>Orchestrator.Web/</span></li>\n  <li data-state=\"bad\" data-note=\"Gap. Holds the self-test in the shipping exe.\"><span>Orchestrator.Tray/</span></li>\n  </ul></li>\n</ul></div>"
    ]
   ],
